^CONVERSION ERROR$
Trailing-return decltype referencing a parameter must be deduced per
instantiation following the argument's cv-qualification. A const and a
non-const instantiation of the same template must not share the deduced
return type. Regression: the const instance reused the non-const one's
parameter type and rejected the const member overload.
